    "done_when": "(1) The twelve certificate-rung brute-force cases, both full MAST carriers, the edge-endpoint invariant and the four contour-tree test files (merge, mesh, conventions, brute force) all pass with JAX_PLATFORMS=cpu in place with pytest --timeout 0, and every receipt is identical to the base revision's on every fixture (nodes, types, edges, values), checked by a committed comparison. (2) A timing table of compile and execute seconds against live vertex count at the 340, 550 and 1074-cell rungs on CPU, before and after, from a committed benchmark mode (benchmarks/contour_tree_brute_force.py already has a timing mode), plus the same three rungs on the H200 after, one job through scripts/nova_lane/run.sh (betelgeuse gpu_0003_grpA, one card, explicit --mem, RECKON_ALLOW_NESTED_LAUNCH=1, JAX_PLATFORMS=cuda). (3) A data-ink figure of execute seconds against vertex count, before and after, under docs/figures/contour-tree-topology-authority/sweep-cost/. State the new complexity from the code. Record baseline_suite and after_suite with absolute paths. While a SLURM job runs write status: blocked with wait_probe [\"sacct\",\"-n\",\"-X\",\"-j\",\"<id>\",\"--format=State\"] and wait_terminal COMPLETED. Every uv command carries --no-sync and nothing runs uv sync. The manifest status is one of complete, blocked or failed.",
